{"resource": {"name": "Police Incidents", "id": "39rt-2rfj", "parent_fxf": [], "description": "Incidents based on initial police reports taken by officers when responding to calls for service. Data is modified for public use. Address and Location are not exact locations of incidents and have been rounded to nearest hundred block. Lat/Long are approximations only based on rounded hundred block. Incidents reported in this dataset may not correlate with 911 Events datasets and calls for Police service. \n\nThe City of Mesa does not disclose information that is inflammatory in nature that impacts our citizens. Crimes reported in this data set have not been adjudicated in a court of law for final determination. \n\nAlthough sensitive crimes are included, the approximate address are NOT included. Therefore aggregate totals of crimes are accurate, without providing sensitive information. Addresses are not included for: sexual abuse, sexual assault, suicide, incest, molestation of a child or homicide. \n\nSimilar information is also provided through the Communitycrimemap.com website, a 3rd party service that visually reviews crime data for Mesa and outlining areas. \n\nSome of the data fields provided are used to report to the Federal Bureau of Investigation. For a listing of data fields and description please see their UCR Program Data Collections page. Alternatively, please see the Bureau of Justice Statistics NIBRS website for a listing of data fields.", "attribution": "Police", "attribution_link": null, "contact_email": null, "type": "dataset", "updatedAt": "2022-07-28T23:32:40.000Z", "createdAt": "2018-01-25T19:37:43.000Z", "metadata_updated_at": "2022-07-28T23:32:40.000Z", "data_updated_at": "2022-07-15T18:15:53.000Z", "columns_name": ["RowID", "Location 1 (state)", "National Incident-Based Crime Reporting System Description", "City", "Latitude", "Street Name", "Street Number", "Address", "Occurred Date", "Crime Type", "Crime ID", "Location 1 (city)", "Location 1 (address)", "Location 1", "National Incident-Based Crime Reporting System Code", "State", "Longitude", "Street Type", "Report Month", "Report Date", "Report Year", "Mesa Census Tracts 2", "Mesa Census Tracts To City Boundary v1.2", "Mesa Census Tracts", "Location 1 (zip)", "Street Direction"], "columns_field_name": ["rowid", "location_1_state", "national_incident_based_crime_reporting_description", "city", "latitude", "street_name", "street_number", "address", "occurred_date", "crime_type", "crime_id", "location_1_city", "location_1_address", "location_1", "national_incident_based_crime_reporting_system_code", "state", "longitude", "street_type", "report_month", "report_date", "report_year", ":@computed_region_y4ir_tfjh", ":@computed_region_c83p_wm8i", ":@computed_region_4svm_3hip", "location_1_zip", "street_direction"], "columns_datatype": ["Text", "Text", "Text", "Text", "Number", "Text", "Text", "Text", "Calendar date", "Text", "Text", "Text", "Text", "Point", "Text", "Text", "Number", "Text", "Text", "Calendar date", "Text", "Number", "Number", "Number", "Text", "Text"], "columns_description": ["Unique identifier for each row of the dataset", "", "A description of the offense based on NIBRS", "City where the incident occurred", "Latitude based on the rounded hundred block. Not an exact latitude of where incident occurred.", "Street Name where the incident occurred", "Street number, rounded to nearest hundred block where the incident occurred. Not the exact location.", "Hundred block location where incident occurred. Exact locations are rounded to nearest hundred block and are not exact.", "Date/Time Date the incident occurred", "Description of the Crime", "This is the departmental incident report number", "", "", "Approximate geocoded location based on the rounded hundred block. Not an exact location of where incident occurred.", "NIBRS offense code", "State where incident occurred", "Longitude based on the rounded hundred block. Not an exact longitude of where inci